> Everyone seems to want a brighter smile, and teeth whit[ening] is[ a great] option for boosting your confidence. If food and drinks have stained your pearly whites, you[ may] be tempted to rush to the drug store and pick up the first over-the-counter whit[ening] product you find. However, while side effects from whit[ening] products are rare, you should follow[ these] tips before ble[aching] your teeth to ensure your safety.
